WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.169
President Trump is threatening
a government shutdown

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.770
over funding
for his border wall

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.906
just as he faces
the most serious legal peril

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.107
of his presidency.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:10.376
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:14.480
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.416
It's worth remembering
that when 2018 began,

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.518
we didn't know anything
about illegal hush payments

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:22.789
to porn stars, a secret resister
inside the Trump administration,

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.324
or the fact that Rudy Giuliani

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.660
always looks like he just sat
on a box of thumbtacks.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.961
When the year began,

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:30.696
Republicans controlled
all three branches of government

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:33.066
and they were celebrating the
passage of a corporate tax cut

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.834
to line the pockets
of millionaires.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.702
And to take a victory lap
at the time,

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:38.304
Trump turned
to his creepiest aide,

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.106
senior adviser Stephen Miller.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.841
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.043
[ Witch cackles ]

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:46.779
-You rang?

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:50.316
-Miller decided to go on TV and
make the President look good --

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.219
A, by comparison, and, B,
by calling him a genius.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.355
-On the campaign,
I had the chance to travel

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.390
all across the country
with the President,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.592
and I saw a man
who was a political genius.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:02.995
The reality is is the President
is a political genius.

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:06.565
All these so-called political
geniuses in Washington,

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:08.968
whether it be at the
big lobbying firms or --

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.604
-The only person who's called
him a genius in the last week

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.772
is the President.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.674
-Because it happens to be
a true statement.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:15.975
-Ugh.

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.311
Stephen Miller is
the only person on Earth

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:22.515
who'd be less creepy
if he wore a hockey mask.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.317
But, hey, maybe
some of Trump's supporters

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:25.651
still thought he was a genius,

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.653
and yet in the almost 12 months
since that comment,

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:29.889
Trump has rambled at length
about how people in Finland

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.058
rake the floors of the forest,

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:33.259
left an umbrella outside

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.495
when he couldn't figure out
how to close it,

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:39.265
got on Air Force One with
toilet paper stuck to his shoe,

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:42.168
and said this about a hurricane.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.704
-They haven't seen anything
like what's coming at us

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:50.176
in 25, 30 years, maybe ever.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.179
It's tremendously big
and tremendously wet.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.714
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.714 --> 00:01:57.217
-Tremendously big
and tremendously wet

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:59.618
sounds like something
Stephen Miller would say

00:01:59.618 --> 00:02:01.988
about Donald Trump.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.356
As we've learned this year,

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:05.959
the President is just
a weird, weird man.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.627
He's like a space alien
with a head injury

00:02:08.627 --> 00:02:10.696
who just took
his first bong rip.

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.531
"It is a pleasure to meet you,
fellow human.

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:16.002
I am enjoying the traditional
Earth greeting of shaking hands

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.636
for exactly one full minute.

00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:20.106
And now let us all
display our patriotism

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:24.877
by engaging in the
customary hugging of the flag.

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.580
I am normal!"

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.049
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:31.617
[ Applause ]

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:33.552
But you'd think
a political genius

00:02:33.552 --> 00:02:35.154
could at least figure out a way

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:38.290
to deliver on the one thing he
repeatedly told his supporters

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.526
he would absolutely do,
and that's build the wall.

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:41.828
And yet today, Trump threatened

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.962
the very real possibility
of a government shutdown

00:02:43.962 --> 00:02:45.898
because he didn't get any money
for the wall.

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:48.801
In fact, it's finally starting
to dawn on his supporters

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.770
that the wall
is never going to happen,

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.006
and they are
very upset about it.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:54.473
-Democrats are
going to win on this.

00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:56.175
There will be no money

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.210
for the President and his wall
this time.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.646
-Not a penny!

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:02.581
Forget wall.
Think border security.

00:03:02.581 --> 00:03:05.117
-I think that not funding
the wall is going to go down

00:03:05.117 --> 00:03:06.920
as one of the
worst, worst things

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.988
to have happened
to this administration.

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:11.958
Forget Mueller. The wall, the
wall, the wall has to be built.

00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:14.294
And this was a scandal
that it hasn't been built.

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:16.595
-Well, it's very sad.
We needed the wall.

00:03:16.595 --> 00:03:18.197
-That's a real fight,
and I don't know

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:19.932
that he minds dragging it out
for a while.

00:03:19.932 --> 00:03:21.333
-Is it something
he just needs --

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:22.802
-...series of
two-week agreements.

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:24.903
-It is something he just
needs to give up on, though?

00:03:24.903 --> 00:03:27.039
-Wow, man. They're talking
about the wall

00:03:27.039 --> 00:03:28.340
like they just lost a pet.

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:30.343
Trump's gonna have to have

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:31.777
a special chat
with the Fox &amp; Friends.

00:03:31.777 --> 00:03:33.846
"Mr. Trump,
where'd the wall go?"

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.182
"It went to a farm upstate

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:39.285
to live with
all the other walls."

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:40.886
Because he knows he's never

00:03:40.886 --> 00:03:42.588
gonna get any money
for his wall.

00:03:42.588 --> 00:03:43.589
Trump has been lying

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:45.457
and claiming
he's already building it

00:03:45.457 --> 00:03:47.727
just by putting up some fencing
with existing money.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.762
But now supporters
are starting to figure out

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.697
that's also a lie.

00:03:51.697 --> 00:03:54.801
Here's Trump lying about the
wall followed by a very confused

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.969
Laura Ingraham trying to
figure out what he means.

00:03:56.969 --> 00:03:59.738
-A lot of wall has been built.
We don't talk about that.

00:03:59.738 --> 00:04:03.309
But we might as well start
because it's building --

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.744
It's being built right now.
Big sections of wall.

00:04:05.744 --> 00:04:08.714
And we will continue that.

00:04:08.714 --> 00:04:11.183
-Uh, wh-- I must have missed
the wall being built.

00:04:11.183 --> 00:04:12.919
What wall?
Where's it being built, Tom?

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:15.788
-I think what he means
is they're upgrading
certain parts of the wall.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:18.090
-That's not a wall.
Stop saying it's a wall.
There's no wall.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.526
If you want a wall,
say, "We don't have the wall."

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:22.228
I know it's bad
because he made the promise,

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:25.064
but they're not
building the wall.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:26.365
-Wow!

00:04:26.365 --> 00:04:29.902
She went through all five stages
of grief in five seconds.

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.337
It's like watching someone

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:33.906
realize they're in the Matrix
in real time.

00:04:33.906 --> 00:04:37.510
"This isn't real!
None of this is real!"

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.678
So, today, Trump,
the political genius,

00:04:39.678 --> 00:04:42.281
said at the last minute
he would not sign a deal

00:04:42.281 --> 00:04:44.350
to keep the government open,
and in response,

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.785
outgoing House Speaker Paul Ryan

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:47.653
scrambled to find a way
to get him money for his wall,

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:49.555
which is a fitting end
to Paul Ryan's career.

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:51.757
Ryan had spent all year
loyally serving Trump

00:04:51.757 --> 00:04:53.659
and ignoring
his many abuses of power,

00:04:53.659 --> 00:04:55.160
even openly admitting

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.029
he doesn't pay attention
to Trump's scandals.

00:04:57.029 --> 00:04:58.897
-Mark Sanford yesterday,

00:04:58.897 --> 00:05:01.166
speaking on
the Stormy Daniels story,

00:05:01.166 --> 00:05:04.036
said allegations of hush money
are a big deal.

00:05:04.036 --> 00:05:06.004
I guess first question is,

00:05:06.004 --> 00:05:09.141
do you agree
with that characterization?

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:12.544
-I haven't put a second
of thought into this.

00:05:12.544 --> 00:05:14.479
It's just not
on my radar screen.

00:05:14.479 --> 00:05:16.148
-This must bother you.

00:05:16.148 --> 00:05:18.650
"Access Hollywood,"
Stormy Daniels, Karen McDougal.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.886
At a certain point,
it must be embarrassing.

00:05:20.886 --> 00:05:23.088
-Well, look,
I didn't read the article.

00:05:23.088 --> 00:05:25.024
-Is it appropriate,
in your view,

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:27.860
for the White House to invoke
executive...and deny --

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.095
-No. I'm not familiar with
exactly what happened yesterday.

00:05:30.095 --> 00:05:31.897
I've been a little busy
with some other tasks.

00:05:31.897 --> 00:05:34.300
-Man, Paul Ryan might be
a bad House Speaker,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.868
but he'd be a great roommate.

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:37.603
"Hey, Paul, my friends
are coming over to watch

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:40.005
the UFC fight, and then
my punk band's gonna practice."

00:05:40.005 --> 00:05:43.543
"That's cool.
I'll be busy with other tasks."

00:05:43.543 --> 00:05:45.378
Yesterday in his
farewell address,

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.780
Ryan decried what he called
our broken politics,

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.815
but Ryan is the one
who spent two years

00:05:49.815 --> 00:05:51.216
ignoring Trump's many scandals

00:05:51.216 --> 00:05:53.519
and actively praising Trump
in truly absurd ways,

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:55.888
like when the GOP passed
their corporate tax cut.

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:59.758
-Something this big,
something this generational,

00:05:59.758 --> 00:06:03.162
something this profound
could not have been done

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:06.331
without exquisite
presidential leadership.

00:06:06.331 --> 00:06:08.166
-I'm sorry. Did you just
use the word "exquisite"

00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:09.969
to describe Donald Trump?

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:12.071
You're talking about him
like he's an art installation

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:13.339
at the Guggenheim.

00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:15.107
He's not exactly a Picasso.

00:06:15.107 --> 00:06:17.776
I mean, look at him.
If he looks like anything,

00:06:17.776 --> 00:06:20.413
he looks like he was painted
by Edvard Munch.

00:06:20.413 --> 00:06:22.181
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:23.983
Although, you know what?
He'd fit right in

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:28.354
in that Salvador Dalí painting
with all those melting clocks.

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:31.457
Watching Ryan frantically
try to scrape together money
for Trump's border wall

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:33.292
is a fitting way
for his career to end.

00:06:33.292 --> 00:06:34.626
Ryan used high-minded rhetoric

00:06:34.626 --> 00:06:36.495
about the importance
of our institutions

00:06:36.495 --> 00:06:38.498
while Trump degraded
those institutions.

00:06:38.498 --> 00:06:40.066
For example,
Ryan had nothing to say

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:41.867
when the President's lawyer,
Rudy Giuliani,

00:06:41.867 --> 00:06:44.770
went on TV and literally said
that truth isn't truth.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.406
-When you tell me that,
you know, he should testify

00:06:47.406 --> 00:06:49.508
because he's going to tell the
truth and he shouldn't worry,

00:06:49.508 --> 00:06:50.976
well, that's so silly because

00:06:50.976 --> 00:06:53.479
it's somebody's version
of the truth, not the truth.

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:55.314
He didn't have a conversation --

00:06:55.314 --> 00:06:57.683
-Truth is truth.
I don't mean to go, like --

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.152
-No, it isn't truth!
Truth isn't truth!

00:07:00.152 --> 00:07:03.121
The President of the United
States says, "I didn't --"

00:07:03.121 --> 00:07:05.291
-Truth is a truth. Mr. Mayor,
do you realize what --

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:07.393
This is gonna become a bad meme.

00:07:07.393 --> 00:07:10.763
-No. No, no.
Don't do this to me.

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:13.465
-In every interview,
every interview,

00:07:13.465 --> 00:07:15.100
Rudy sounds like a grandpa

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.402
whose adult children
just put him in a nursing home.

00:07:17.402 --> 00:07:19.138
"Don't do this to me!

00:07:19.138 --> 00:07:22.841
I can live on my own!
Just get me a stair lift!"

00:07:22.841 --> 00:07:25.744
Also, can we go back
to this part real quick?

00:07:25.744 --> 00:07:28.414
-This is gonna become
a bad meme.

00:07:28.414 --> 00:07:32.351
-Chuck Todd, why are you talking
to this guy about memes?

00:07:32.351 --> 00:07:34.654
He doesn't know what a meme is.

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:36.956
Rudy probably things a meme
is one of those guys

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:40.026
who pretends to be trapped
behind an invisible wall.

00:07:40.026 --> 00:07:41.694
Well, truth is truth,
and now the truth

00:07:41.694 --> 00:07:43.428
is starting to catch up
to Rudy and Trump

00:07:43.428 --> 00:07:45.097
like when we learned recently
that Trump

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:46.699
and his former lawyer,
Michael Cohen,

00:07:46.699 --> 00:07:49.401
had lied about plans to build
a Trump Tower in Moscow

00:07:49.401 --> 00:07:50.769
during the 2016 campaign.

00:07:50.769 --> 00:07:52.071
After insisting that he never

00:07:52.071 --> 00:07:53.572
had any business deals
in Russia,

00:07:53.572 --> 00:07:55.708
Trump went back on all that
and admitted he did try

00:07:55.708 --> 00:07:57.276
to build a Trump Tower in Moscow

00:07:57.276 --> 00:07:58.978
but insisted it wasn't
that big a deal.

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:02.514
-It was during
the early part of '16

00:08:02.514 --> 00:08:03.815
and I guess even before that.

00:08:03.815 --> 00:08:06.385
It lasted
a short period of time.

00:08:06.385 --> 00:08:09.655
I didn't do the project.
I decided not to do the project.

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:13.325
So I didn't do it. So we're not
talking about doing a project.

00:08:13.325 --> 00:08:15.494
We're talking about
not doing a project.

00:08:15.494 --> 00:08:18.764
We decided -- I decided
ultimately not to do it.

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:20.933
There would have been
nothing wrong if I did do it.

00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:23.135
If I did do it, there would have
been nothing wrong.

00:08:23.135 --> 00:08:27.572
That was a project that
we didn't do, I didn't do.

00:08:27.572 --> 00:08:30.976
It was just reported very well
by Catherine Herridge,

00:08:30.976 --> 00:08:33.246
who's a terrific reporter
on Fox.

00:08:33.246 --> 00:08:35.814
She talks about a letter
that he signed.

00:08:35.814 --> 00:08:37.850
I don't even remember it.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.319
And it specifically
talks about this deal.

00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:43.021
-Trump only knows three words,
and then when he runs out,

00:08:43.021 --> 00:08:46.358
he starts drawing invisible
squares with his hand.

00:08:46.358 --> 00:08:49.528
I guess you could call him
a French meme.

00:08:49.528 --> 00:08:51.630
The Trump Tower project
was apparently so serious

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.866
that there was actually
an official letter of intent

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:56.001
signaling that Trump
wanted to go forward with it.

00:08:56.001 --> 00:08:57.302
Now, you heard Trump there say

00:08:57.302 --> 00:08:59.171
he didn't really know
anything about that letter.

00:08:59.171 --> 00:09:01.107
And on top of that,
Rudy insists that the letter

00:09:01.107 --> 00:09:02.875
wasn't a big deal
for one important reason.

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:05.010
He told CNN there was
a letter of intent to go forward

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.712
but no one signed it.

00:09:06.712 --> 00:09:08.314
Oh, come on, Rudy.
That's your excuse?

00:09:08.314 --> 00:09:09.749
No one signed it? What's next?

00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:12.818
"He tried to mail it, but he
doesn't know Putin's address."

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:14.486
[ Laughter ]

00:09:14.486 --> 00:09:16.922
Well, you will never guess
what happened.

00:09:16.922 --> 00:09:19.358
This week, we found out
that Rudy was either lying

00:09:19.358 --> 00:09:21.593
or very wrong when he said
no one signed the letter.

00:09:21.593 --> 00:09:23.529
-This is the letter of intent

00:09:23.529 --> 00:09:26.131
for the proposed
Trump Tower Moscow.

00:09:26.131 --> 00:09:29.802
All right?
It is signed by Donald J. Trump.

00:09:29.802 --> 00:09:33.072
It's a lot of pages, man,
with a lot of detail

00:09:33.072 --> 00:09:35.040
about what they wanted
and how they wanted it

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.309
and how he'd be paid.

00:09:36.309 --> 00:09:38.277
And there's his signature. Okay?

00:09:38.277 --> 00:09:40.846
-So Trump lied
about the letter, too.

00:09:40.846 --> 00:09:43.949
Mr. President, let me put this
in a way you'll understand.

00:09:43.949 --> 00:09:46.919
You went on TV and said
you didn't sign the letter.

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:50.122
But now the feds might bust down
your door and put you in a cell,

00:09:50.122 --> 00:09:52.925
and then we'll be stuck
with President Mike Pence.

00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:55.194
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:55.194 --> 00:09:58.296
So...

00:09:58.296 --> 00:10:00.899
how did Rudy explain the fact
that Trump's signature

00:10:00.899 --> 00:10:02.768
actually does appear
in the letter?

00:10:02.768 --> 00:10:04.536
He said he was confused.

00:10:04.536 --> 00:10:09.575
-Rudy Giuliani is commenting
to our Dana Bash, a new comment.

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:11.109
I'm seeing that he was wrong

00:10:11.109 --> 00:10:13.945
if he said that the President
didn't sign this letter.

00:10:13.945 --> 00:10:15.914
He said,
"I haven't seen the quote,

00:10:15.914 --> 00:10:18.850
but I probably meant to say
that there was never a deal,

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:20.720
much less a signed one."

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:24.389
So some very, very confusing
statements from Rudy Giuliani.

00:10:24.389 --> 00:10:25.891
You don't want a lawyer,

00:10:25.891 --> 00:10:28.093
especially one working for the
President of the United States,

00:10:28.093 --> 00:10:29.895
who is going to say two things

00:10:29.895 --> 00:10:32.631
completely opposite
of one another.

00:10:32.631 --> 00:10:34.600
-You wouldn't,
but that's exactly

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.836
the kind of lawyer
Donald Trump wants.

00:10:36.836 --> 00:10:38.537
He thinks he's
psyching everyone out

00:10:38.537 --> 00:10:40.372
by putting a crazy person on TV.

00:10:40.372 --> 00:10:42.375
Trump watched "Lethal Weapon"
and thought,

00:10:42.375 --> 00:10:44.110
"I want a lawyer like that!"

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.912
Every Rudy interview
basically goes like this.

00:10:46.912 --> 00:10:48.580
-Joining me now
is the President's attorney.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.350
-Yeah, you want to see crazy?

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.218
-Trump is in serious
legal jeopardy

00:10:53.218 --> 00:10:55.687
just as Democrats prepare
to take over the House,

00:10:55.687 --> 00:10:57.990
and he's hoping he can
salvage his presidency

00:10:57.990 --> 00:10:59.825
by threatening a shutdown
over his wall.

00:10:59.825 --> 00:11:02.328
I'm not saying he's scared,
but his pants are...

00:11:02.328 --> 00:11:03.929
-Tremendously wet.

00:11:03.929 --> 00:11:06.732
-This has been "A Closer Look."

